+\begin{theorem}[existence of the occupation wave operators]
+\label{v4-arith:w7-j:prop:wave-existence}
+The strong limits
+\[
+ \Omega_\pm=\lim_{t\to\pm\infty}e^{itD}e^{-itD_0}
